Review PR #545 in this repository.

1. Get the PR diff: `gh pr diff 545`
2. Get PR details: `gh pr view 545 --json title,body,files`
3. Check the PR body for `Task: @task-ref` or `Spec: @spec-ref` trailers.
   - The task is @task-e2e-daemon-inbox-api. Run `kspec task get @task-e2e-daemon-inbox-api` to get spec context.
   - Check acceptance criteria coverage for @api-contract ac-12, ac-13, ac-14
4. Review the code for:
   - Correctness and potential bugs
   - Own AC coverage: every spec AC should have test with `// AC: @spec-ref ac-N` annotation
   - Trait AC coverage: run `kspec item get @api-contract` to find inherited trait ACs. Each needs test with `// AC: @trait-slug ac-N` annotation
   - Run `kspec validate` — trait AC coverage warnings are MUST-FIX
   - Spec alignment: implementation matches spec intent, not just syntax
   - Code quality: duplicated logic, ignored shared utilities, inconsistent patterns
   - Test quality: no fluff tests, prefer E2E over unit, tests should actually test behavior
5. Write a review body JSON file to /tmp/codex-pr-review-body.json:
   {"event":"COMMENT","body":"summary","comments":[{"path":"file","line":N,"body":"comment"}]}
   Then post: gh api repos/kynetic-ai/kynetic-spec/pulls/545/reviews --method POST --input /tmp/codex-pr-review-body.json
6. Also write the full review to /tmp/codex-pr-545-review.md

Do NOT use REQUEST_CHANGES event — use COMMENT only (GitHub prohibits requesting changes on your own PRs).

Severity levels: MUST-FIX, SHOULD-FIX, SUGGESTION.
