## Summary

- Replaced 218 lines of static analysis in `tests/daemon-api-inbox.test.ts` with 20 Playwright E2E tests in `packages/web-ui/tests/e2e/api-inbox.spec.ts`
- All tests make real HTTP calls against a running daemon instance using the daemon fixture
- Covers @api-contract ac-12 (GET /api/inbox ordering), ac-13 (POST creates with ULID), ac-14 (DELETE removes item)

## Test plan

- [x] `GET /api/inbox`: returns items, ordered by created_at desc, correct fields, fixture data integrity
- [x] `POST /api/inbox`: creates item with ULID, supports optional tags/added_by, validates required text (400/422)
- [x] `DELETE /api/inbox/:ref`: deletes by ULID ref, verifies item removed from list, 404 for bad ref
- [x] Ordering invariant: newly created items appear at top of list
- [x] All 1212 unit tests still pass (`npm run test:shard1`)
- [x] Static analysis file `tests/daemon-api-inbox.test.ts` deleted

